{"step_index":191,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-10-24T15:38:25Z","input_tokens":4463,"cache_read_tokens":109614,"output_tokens":16918,"thinking":"Planning begins for the `ClientList.tsx` component, aiming for a user-friendly interface for gym clients. Initial focus is on defining the component's internal state. Key state variables will include a search string, and filters for client status and tier.\n\n\nDefining component state necessitates considering sorting options, view modes (table, grid, desk), and modal visibility/selection states for client interactions. Specifically, the \"Pase Rápido\" action requires a toast for access feedback and integration with biometric verification, visit logging, and sound cues. The top header will include the title, brand, description, live hardware status, and actions.\n\n\nPlanning the UI components now includes actionable elements at the top: an Excel export and a \"New Client\" button. Five KPI cards will visually represent key data points like total members, active members, expiring members, expired members, and those without fingerprints, all with clickable filter actions.\n\nSearch and filter controls are being designed with input field, status pills for quick filtering, dropdowns for plan tiers and sorting options, and a view mode switcher for table, card, and renewal views. The table view will require refined styling.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"import React, { useState, useMemo } from 'react';\nimport { useGym } from '../../context/GymContext';\nimport { Client, MembershipPlanType } from '../../types';\nimport { getGymAvatar, getOfflineGymSvgAvatar, detectGender } from '../../utils/genderAvatar';\nimport { exportClientsToExcel } from '../../utils/excelExport';\nimport { sounds } from '../../services/audio';\n\n// Modals\nimport { ClientFormModal } from './ClientFormModal';\nimport { ClientEditModal } from './ClientEditModal';\nimport { ClientDetailModal } from './ClientDetailModal';\nimport { BiometricEnrollModal } from './BiometricEnrollModal';\nimport { RenewMembershipModal } from './RenewMembershipModal';\nimport { ClientCredentialModal } from './ClientCredentialModal';\n\nimport { \n  Users, \n  UserPlus, \n  Search, \n  Fingerprint, \n  RefreshCw, \n  Eye, \n  Trash2, \n  Phone, \n  Mail, \n  Pencil, \n  LayoutGrid, \n  List, \n  ChevronRight,\n  Download,\n  CheckCircle2,\n  AlertTriangle,\n  Clock,\n  Award,\n  Crown,\n  Share2,\n  QrCode,\n  DoorOpen,\n  ArrowUpDown,\n  Filter,\n  X,\n  Sparkles,\n  Zap,\n  Activity,\n  Calendar,\n  MessageCircle,\n  ShieldCheck,\n  Flame,\n  Check,\n  AlertCircle\n} from 'lucide-react';\n\nexport const ClientList: React.FC = () => {\n  const { \n    members, \n    deleteMember, \n    currentRole, \n    verifyBiometricAccess,\n    todayCheckInsCount,\n    activeBranch \n  } = useGym();\n\n  // Filters & Search\n  const [search, setSearch] = useState('');\n  const [statusFilter, setStatusFilter] = useState<'all' | 'active' | 'expiring_soon' | 'expired' | 'no_fingerprint'>('all');\n  const [tierFilter, setTierFilter] = useState<string>('all');\n  const [sortBy, setSortBy] = useState<'urgency' | 'checkins' | 'name' | 'recent'>('urgency');\n  const [viewMode, setViewMode] = useState<'table' | 'grid' | 'desk'>('table');\n\n  // Modals state\n  const [showAddModal, setShowAddModal] = useState(false);\n  const [selectedClientForDetail, setSelectedClientForDetail] = useState<Client | null>(null);\n  const [selectedClientForEdit, setSelectedClientForEdit] = useState<Client | null>(null);\n  const [selectedClientForEnroll, setSelectedClientForEnroll] = useState<Client | null>(null);\n  const [selectedClientForRenew, setSelectedClientForRenew] = useState<Client | null>(null);\n  const [selectedClientForCredential, setSelectedClientForCredential] = useState<Client | null>(null);\n\n  // Live Toast for Quick Turnstile / Access Test\n  const [accessToast, setAccessToast] = useState<{\n    visible: boolean;\n    granted: boolean;\n    clientName: string;\n    message: string;\n  } | null>(null);\n\n  // Quick Turnstile Access Simulator\n  const handleQuickAccessCheck = (e: React.MouseEvent, client: Client) => {\n    e.stopPropagation();\n    const result = verifyBiometricAccess(client.id);\n\n    if (result.granted) {\n      setAccessToast({\n        visible: true,\n        granted: true,\n        clientName: client.fullName,\n        message: `¡Pase Autorizado! Torniquete 1 Abierto • ${client.membership.planName}`,\n      });\n    } else {\n      setAccessToast({\n        visible: true,\n        granted: false,\n        clientName: client.fullName,\n        message: result.reason || 'Acceso denegado: membresía inactiva o vencida',\n      });\n    }\n\n    setTimeout(() => {\n      setAccessToast(null);\n    }, 4000);\n  };\n\n  // One-click WhatsApp message builder\n  const handleSendWhatsApp = (e: React.MouseEvent, client: Client) => {\n    e.stopPropagation();\n    if (!client.phone) return;\n\n    const isExpired = client.membership.status === 'expired' || client.membership.daysRemaining < 0;\n    const isExpiring = client.membership.daysRemaining <= 5 && !isExpired;\n\n    let message = '';\n    if (isExpired) {\n      const daysOverdue = Math.abs(client.membership.daysRemaining);\n      message = `Hola ${client.fullName}! Te saludamos de Legends Pro Gym. Te recordamos que tu membresia (${client.membership.planName}) vencio hace ${daysOverdue} dias. Te extrañamos entrenando! Pasa a recepcion a renovarla y mantener tu condicion al maximo.`;\n    } else if (isExpiring) {\n      message = `Hola ${client.fullName}! Te saludamos de Legends Pro Gym. Te recordamos cordialmente que tu membresia (${client.membership.planName}) vence en ${client.membership.daysRemaining} dias (${client.membership.endDate}). Puedes renovar en caja con efectivo, tarjeta o transferencia para evitar interrupciones en tu acceso.`;\n    } else {\n      message = `Hola ${client.fullName}! Te saludamos de Legends Pro Gym. Tu membresia (${client.membership.planName}) se encuentra activa y vigente. Tienes alguna duda o solicitud especial en tu entrenamiento? Estamos a tu orden!`;\n    }\n\n    const cleanPhone = client.phone.replace(/\\D/g, '');\n    window.open(`https://wa.me/${cleanPhone}?text=${encodeURIComponent(message)}`, '_blank');\n  };\n\n  // Filter & Sort Logic\n  const filteredMembers = useMemo(() => {\n    return members\n      .filter((member) => {\n        // Search query\n        const q = search.toLowerCase().trim();\n        const matchesSearch = \n          !q ||\n          member.fullName.toLowerCase().includes(q) ||\n          member.documentId.toLowerCase().includes(q) ||\n          member.phone.toLowerCase().includes(q) ||\n          member.id.toLowerCase().includes(q) ||\n          member.email.toLowerCase().includes(q) ||\n          member.membership.planName.toLowerCase().includes(q);\n\n        if (!matchesSearch) return false;\n\n        // Status Filter\n        const isExpired = member.membership.status === 'expired' || member.membership.daysRemaining < 0;\n        const isExpiring = member.membership.daysRemaining <= 5 && !isExpired;\n        const isActive = member.membership.daysRemaining > 5 && !isExpired;\n\n        if (statusFilter === 'active' && !isActive) return false;\n        if (statusFilter === 'expiring_soon' && !isExpiring) return false;\n        if (statusFilter === 'expired' && !isExpired) return false;\n        if (statusFilter === 'no_fingerprint' && member.biometricRegistered) return false;\n\n        // Plan Tier Filter\n        if (tierFilter !== 'all') {\n          const planNameLower = member.membership.planName.toLowerCase();\n          const planType = member.membership.planType;\n          if (tierFilter === 'vip' && planType !== 'vip' && !planNameLower.includes('vip') && !planNameLower.includes('black')) return false;\n          if (tierFilter === 'monthly' && planType !== 'monthly' && !planNameLower.includes('mensual')) return false;\n          if (tierFilter === 'quarterly' && planType !== 'quarterly' && !planNameLower.includes('trimestral')) return false;\n          if (tierFilter === 'daily' && planType !== 'daily' && !planNameLower.includes('día') && !planNameLower.includes('dia') && !planNameLower.includes('pass')) return false;\n        }\n\n        return true;\n      })\n      .sort((a, b) => {\n        if (sortBy === 'urgency') {\n          // Sort by days remaining ascending (expired/expiring first)\n          return a.membership.daysRemaining - b.membership.daysRemaining;\n        }\n        if (sortBy === 'checkins') {\n          return (b.checkInsCount || 0) - (a.checkInsCount || 0);\n        }\n        if (sortBy === 'name') {\n          return a.fullName.localeCompare(b.fullName);\n        }\n        if (sortBy === 'recent') {\n          return (b.createdAt || '').localeCompare(a.createdAt || '');\n        }\n        return 0;\n      });\n  }, [members, search, statusFilter, tierFilter, sortBy]);\n\n  // Counts for KPI Summary\n  const totalCount = members.length;\n  const activeCount = members.filter(m => m.membership.daysRemaining > 5 && m.membership.status !== 'expired').length;\n  const expiringCount = members.filter(m => m.membership.daysRemaining <= 5 && m.membership.daysRemaining >= 0 && m.membership.status !== 'expired').length;\n  const expiredCount = members.filter(m => m.membership.status === 'expired' || m.membership.daysRemaining < 0).length;\n  const noFingerprintCount = members.filter(m => !m.biometricRegistered).length;\n\n  return (\n    <div className=\"space-y-5\">\n      \n      {/* Dynamic Access Test Toast */}\n      {accessToast && (\n        <div className={`fixed top-4 right-4 z-50 p-4 rounded-2xl border shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-md max-w-md animate-fade-in flex items-start gap-3 ${\n          accessToast.granted \n            ? 'bg-[#0b1d14]/95 border-emerald-500/60 shadow-emerald-500/20 text-white' \n            : 'bg-[#21090a]/95 border-red-500/60 shadow-red-500/20 text-white'\n        }`}>\n          <div className={`p-2 rounded-xl shrink-0 ${\n            accessToast.granted ? 'bg-emerald-500/20 text-emerald-400' : 'bg-red-500/20 text-red-400'\n          }`}>\n            {accessToast.granted ? <CheckCircle2 className=\"w-5 h-5\" /> : <AlertCircle className=\"w-5 h-5\" />}\n          </div>\n          <div className=\"flex-1 min-w-0\">\n            <h4 className=\"font-extrabold text-sm flex items-center justify-between\">\n 